{"id":51214,"date":"2026-05-12T07:33:30","date_gmt":"2026-05-12T06:33:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vianafit-race\/"},"modified":"2026-09-02T19:31:57","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T18:31:57","slug":"vieirafit-race","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vieirafit-race\/","title":{"rendered":"VieiraFit Race 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">VieiraFit Race 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>VieiraFit Race 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>12 de setembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), no cora\u00e7\u00e3o de <strong>Vieira do Minho<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>4FITGIM, LDA<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vieira do Minho<\/strong> e da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva de Vieira<\/strong>, a prova destaca-se como uma das mais empolgantes corridas de obst\u00e1culos (OCR) da regi\u00e3o norte, aliando supera\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva a uma causa solid\u00e1ria de apoio comunit\u00e1rio local.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e meta no centro urbano e partidas organizadas em vagas a partir das <strong>14:30<\/strong>, o percurso de <strong>10 km<\/strong> desafia os participantes com mais de <strong>30 obst\u00e1culos<\/strong> naturais e artificiais \u2014 desde pir\u00e2mides de madeira e paredes verticais a fardos, po\u00e7as de lama, escadas e trincheiras \u2014, integrando escal\u00f5es de competi\u00e7\u00e3o federada (Liga FPOCR e Internacional) e a categoria l\u00fadica Guerreiros.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 14:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; mi