t-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31 Mai)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 22.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 28 Jun)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 26.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 26 Jul)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">5\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 30.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30 Ago)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">OCR Divers\u00e3o<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Guerreiros (Open \/ Divers\u00e3o)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 12 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 14:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 17 Mai)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31 Mai)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 28 Jun)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 22.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 26 Jul)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">5\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 25.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30 Ago)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a VieiraFit Race 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A corrida realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 12 de setembro de 2026, com partida e chegada no centro da vila de Vieira do Minho, distrito de Braga.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia e o n\u00famero de obst\u00e1culos da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso conta com cerca de 10 km de extens\u00e3o e integra mais de 30 obst\u00e1culos naturais e constru\u00eddos, tais como paredes, trincheiras, pir\u00e2mides de madeira e passagens aqu\u00e1ticas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es e hor\u00e1rios de partida dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As partidas decorrem a partir das 14:30 em blocos espa\u00e7ados de 10 em 10 minutos, divididas entre Elite\/Competitive (Liga FPOCR) e o escal\u00e3o Guerreiros de lazer.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que acontece se um atleta n\u00e3o conseguir ultrapassar um obst\u00e1culo?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No escal\u00e3o Guerreiros, a recusa ou impossibilidade de transpor um obst\u00e1culo implica uma penaliza\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva de 10 burpees sob supervis\u00e3o dos ju\u00edzes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e como posso levantar o kit de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O kit com dorsal e chip obrigat\u00f3rio pode ser levantado nos dias 9 a 11 de setembro no Gin\u00e1sio VieiraFit ou no secretariado no dia do evento entre as 10h00 e as 14h00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"VieiraFit Race 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-12\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Centro de Vieira do Minho, Pra\u00e7a Guilherme de Abreu\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vieira do Minho\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"4FITGIM, LDA \/ C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vieira do Minho\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a VieiraFit Race 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A corrida realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 12 de setembro de 2026, com partida e chegada no centro da vila de Vieira do Minho, distrito de Braga.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia e o n\u00famero de obst\u00e1culos da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O percurso conta com cerca de 10 km de extens\u00e3o e integra mais de 30 obst\u00e1culos naturais e constru\u00eddos, tais como paredes, trincheiras, pir\u00e2mides de madeira e passagens aqu\u00e1ticas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es e hor\u00e1rios de partida dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As partidas decorrem a partir das 14:30 em blocos espa\u00e7ados de 10 em 10 minutos, divididas entre Elite\/Competitive (Liga FPOCR) e o escal\u00e3o Guerreiros de lazer.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que acontece se um atleta n\u00e3o conseguir ultrapassar um obst\u00e1culo?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No escal\u00e3o Guerreiros, a recusa ou impossibilidade de transpor um obst\u00e1culo implica uma penaliza\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva de 10 burpees sob supervis\u00e3o dos ju\u00edzes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e como posso levantar o kit de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O kit com dorsal e chip obrigat\u00f3rio pode ser levantado nos dias 9 a 11 de setembro no Gin\u00e1sio VieiraFit ou no secretariado no dia do evento entre as 10h00 e as 14h00.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":51215,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[519],"event_type_2":[52,726],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51214","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-viana-do-castelo","event_type-obstaculos","event_type_2-braga","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_4-solidarias-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/202